window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-091-3ef289be9e5605b8.json"]={sha256:"3ef289be9e5605b8981056d2623736887cbbae49fed3b17b01bf6cbcad80e02f",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-01fa52816728d6be","url":"https://sre.google/workbook/alerting-on-slos/","title":"Google SRE Workbook: alerting on SLOs","titleEn":"Google SRE Workbook: alerting on SLOs","publisher":"Google","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-091","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-091","related":[{"id":"security-v27-092","referenceUrls":["https://sre.google/sre-book/handling-overload/"],"title":"Google SRE：多層重試的組合放大與單層預算","titleEn":"Google SRE: combinatorial retry amplification and single-layer budgets","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付window-counts.csv、burn-rates.json、alert-truth-table.csv與budget-assumptions.md，保留錯誤分母、視窗邊界及流量假設。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver window-counts.csv, burn-rates.json, alert-truth-table.csv and budget-assumptions.md. Preserve request denominators, window boundaries and traffic assumptions so reviewers can separate budget accounting from notification state.","difference":"明確定義attempt包含第一次、retry不包含第一次；比較每層最多三次attempt與僅最靠近故障層重試的最壞呼叫數。","differenceEn":"Define attempt to include the initial call and retry to exclude it. Compare a maximum of three attempts at every layer with retries confined to the layer directly above the failure.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["SRE以相對SLO允許錯誤比例的速率描述burn；多視窗可檢查錯誤是否持續。下面固定流量假設只用於把一小時消耗映射到30日預算。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 SLO99.9%，允許比例0.001；長窗1小時錯誤0.01，短窗5分鐘錯誤0.002；教學門檻兩窗burn都大於6，期間720小時。 長窗burn=0.01/0.001=10，短窗2未過6；固定流量下一小時消耗10/720=1.388889%的總預算。","SRE過載處理討論分層重試放大及預算；本例假設每次都失敗、同步串列且沒有快取，計算最壞嘗試次數而非預期成功率。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 三個重試層A,B,C，每層一次上游呼叫最多發出3個下游attempt。單一root_id貫穿所有合成記錄，attempt_id不可重用。 多層重試最底層3×3×3=27次；僅C最多三次、A/B各一次，最底層只有3次，降低24次。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["SRE burn rate compares observed error fraction with the fraction permitted by the SLO. Multiple windows check whether errors continue; constant traffic is assumed only when mapping one hour of consumption to a thirty-day budget. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. The SLO is 99.9%, allowing an error fraction of 0.001. The one-hour ratio is 0.01 and five-minute ratio 0.002; the teaching threshold requires both burn rates above six over a 720-hour period. Long-window burn is 0.01/0.001=10, while short-window burn is two and fails the threshold. Under constant traffic, that hour consumes 10/720=1.388889% of the total budget.","SRE overload guidance addresses layered retry amplification and budgets. This fixture assumes every attempt fails, execution is synchronous and serial, and no cache intervenes; it counts worst-case attempts, not expected success probability. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. Retry layers A, B and C each issue at most three downstream attempts for one upstream call. A single root_id links the synthetic trace, while every attempt_id remains distinct. Layered retries generate 3×3×3=27 leaf attempts. With only C allowed three attempts and A/B each allowed one, the leaf receives three attempts, a reduction of twenty-four.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-001","referenceUrls":["https://spiffe.io/docs/latest/spiffe-specs/spiffe_federation/"],"title":"SPIFFE 聯邦：信任束輪替與傳播餘裕","titleEn":"SPIFFE federation: bundle rotation and propagation margin","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付window-counts.csv、burn-rates.json、alert-truth-table.csv與budget-assumptions.md，保留錯誤分母、視窗邊界及流量假設。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver window-counts.csv, burn-rates.json, alert-truth-table.csv and budget-assumptions.md. Preserve request denominators, window boundaries and traffic assumptions so reviewers can separate budget accounting from notification state.","difference":"畫出簽發端、bundle endpoint、快取及工作負載四個節點；建立舊根、新根、發布時間、簽發切換與舊憑證到期的事件表。信任域、endpoint URL及profile由可信設定綁定，不能讓下載的bundle自證初始信任。","differenceEn":"Draw issuer, bundle endpoint, cache and workload. Build an event table for roots, publication, issuance cutover and final old-certificate expiry. Bind trust domain, endpoint URL and profile through trusted configuration; the downloaded bundle cannot authenticate its own initial trust.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["SRE以相對SLO允許錯誤比例的速率描述burn；多視窗可檢查錯誤是否持續。下面固定流量假設只用於把一小時消耗映射到30日預算。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 SLO99.9%，允許比例0.001；長窗1小時錯誤0.01，短窗5分鐘錯誤0.002；教學門檻兩窗burn都大於6，期間720小時。 長窗burn=0.01/0.001=10，短窗2未過6；固定流量下一小時消耗10/720=1.388889%的總預算。","新根先傳播再用來簽發；本地保守傳播預算採三次刷新間隔加內部散布延遲。這是教學服務目標，並非規格保證所有客戶端準時刷新。 刷新提示120秒、散布延遲45秒，預計發布後600秒切換簽發；所有時鐘已對齊，未計連續斷線。 可用餘裕600−(3×120+45)=195秒；刷新間隔改180秒時餘裕只剩15秒，不能仍宣稱同樣容錯能力。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["SRE burn rate compares observed error fraction with the fraction permitted by the SLO. Multiple windows check whether errors continue; constant traffic is assumed only when mapping one hour of consumption to a thirty-day budget. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. The SLO is 99.9%, allowing an error fraction of 0.001. The one-hour ratio is 0.01 and five-minute ratio 0.002; the teaching threshold requires both burn rates above six over a 720-hour period. Long-window burn is 0.01/0.001=10, while short-window burn is two and fails the threshold. Under constant traffic, that hour consumes 10/720=1.388889% of the total budget.","Publish a new root before using it to issue identities. The local conservative budget uses three refresh intervals plus internal dissemination delay; this is a teaching service objective, not a guarantee that every client refreshes on time. Use a 120-second refresh hint, 45-second internal dissemination delay and issuance cutover 600 seconds after publication. Clocks are aligned; prolonged disconnection is deliberately outside the nominal model. Margin is 600−(3×120+45)=195 seconds. Increasing refresh to 180 seconds leaves 15 seconds, demonstrating that unchanged cutover time does not preserve the original delay tolerance.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-237b1f08ae2de38b","url":"https://sre.google/sre-book/handling-overload/","title":"Google SRE Book: handling overload","titleEn":"Google SRE Book: handling overload","publisher":"Google","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-5d270ea0cb6e60ce","url":"https://spiffe.io/docs/latest/spiffe-specs/spiffe_federation/","title":"SPIFFE Federation specification","titleEn":"SPIFFE Federation specification","publisher":"SPIFFE","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
